      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 mb-12 sm:mb-16 w-full px-4 sm:px-0">
        <a href="/biaya" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-3.5 sm:py-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 to-cyan-500 text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-xl shadow-teal-500/30 hover:shadow-cyan-500/50 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition duration-200">
          <i class="fas fa-tags mr-2"></i> Lihat Daftar Harga (Pricelist)
        </a>
        <a href="/layanan" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-3.5 sm:py-4 rounded-2xl glass-card text-slate-200 font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition duration-200">
          <i class="fas fa-layer-group mr-2 text-cyan-400"></i> Pelajari Layanan Modul
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 sm:gap-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full px-2 sm:px-0">
        <div class="glass-card p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-cyan-400">100%</div>
          <div class="text-[9px] sm:text-[11px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-semibold mt-1">Kerahasiaan Akun</div>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-teal-400">ICD-10</div>
          <div class="text-[9px] sm:text-[11px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-semibold mt-1">Kode ICD-10 Tepat</div>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-indigo-400">1 Hari</div>
          <div class="text-[9px] sm:text-[11px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-semibold mt-1">Opsi Express Kilat</div>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-pink-400">Valid</div>
          <div class="text-[9px] sm:text-[11px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-semibold mt-1">Garansi Approval DP</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
